    "turn_text": "Absolutely now, I know you're in what is a very busy time as the session has begun, the legislative session has begun here in the state of Oregon. And I want to just jump straight into it and sort of talk about police accountability, because I know that's a top priority of the BIPOC caucus. And you've championed the slate of bills on accountability around several of characters of police officers themselves as well as some of these bills in their regard. Just for starters, which one or ones would you say are some of the most crucial to enact real change? And we should hopefully be able to see that sort of instantly this year.",
