    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "Absolutely. And I want to kind of start off before asking about some of the bills in particular. I want to kind of keep a victim first mentality here. Have there been any cases that have influenced, and I'm speaking more so to the state of Oregon, obviously, but that have influenced some of the slated bills that have been proposed or has it just kind of been an ongoing conversation that led us to the point where these are some of the bills that have come to be presented by way of just different conversations and things that have happened across the country.",
