    "turn_text": "Absolutely. Now, I want to talk about House Bill 2929 that you sponsored, and you kind of referred to a little bit. And this bill would make it an officer's duty to report misconduct and requires the law enforcement unit to investigate reports of conduct. Is this not required now? And also with this apply to all law enforcement, state, city, and county.",
