    "turn_text": "Got it, got it. Let's move on to House Bill 2930, which would establish a commission on statewide law enforcement standards of conduct and discipline to adopt uniform standards of conduct for law enforcement officers and disciplinary standards. I think some people would be a bit surprised that this doesn't already exist. It would also remove the discipline guide or matrix from mandatory, subjective bargaining. Can you just speak to more as to why HB 2930 would be significant?",
